# Changes to licensing, security policy and CI require a deliberate review.
#
# This guards the files where a mistake is quiet and expensive - and, per the
# supply-chain guideline, keeps an AI coding agent from altering licence or security
# configuration without a human in the loop.
#
# Replace @trillion-labs/maintainers with the real team handle before this takes effect;
# CODEOWNERS silently does nothing if the owner does not exist.

/LICENSE                      @trillion-labs/maintainers
/NOTICE                       @trillion-labs/maintainers
/COMPLIANCE.md                @trillion-labs/maintainers
/SECURITY.md                  @trillion-labs/maintainers
/docs/supply-chain/           @trillion-labs/maintainers
/.github/workflows/           @trillion-labs/maintainers
/.github/dependabot.yml       @trillion-labs/maintainers
/tools/                       @trillion-labs/maintainers

# The fetch recipes are the install path for both two-stream code paths.
/train/block_gated_delta_rule/   @trillion-labs/maintainers
/inference/sglang/               @trillion-labs/maintainers
